DLLs bundled in the Windows archive (bin/)
================================================================================

The Windows archive copies every DLL that libyse.dll needs from MSYS2 Clang64.
Licenses below are those declared by the MSYS2 package that provides each DLL
(`pacman -Qi`); each project's own license file ships in its MSYS2 package
(usually under share/licenses/<package>/).

    DLL                 Project (MSYS2 package)   License
    ------------------  ------------------------  ----------------------------
    libportaudio.dll    PortAudio                 MIT-style (above)
    librtmidi-*.dll     RtMidi                    MIT-style (above)
    libsndfile-1.dll    libsndfile                LGPL-2.1-or-later
    libFLAC.dll         FLAC                      BSD-3-Clause (Xiph)
    libogg-0.dll        libogg                    BSD-3-Clause
    libvorbis-0.dll     libvorbis                 custom (Xiph.Org)
    libvorbisenc-2.dll  libvorbis                 custom (Xiph.Org)
    libopus-0.dll       Opus                      BSD-3-Clause
